# Testing Policy

- Use pytest under `tests/`.
- Every test must assert an observable outcome.
- No bare `except:`.
- Prefer deterministic fixtures: fixed RNG seed; mutation/flaw rates = 0 for replication tests.
- Cover exceptions (`TierraError` family), logging boundary (no `pytierra.services.isa` logs in hot path), and soft resource limits (`max_cells`).
- Package coverage: `pytest --cov=pytierra --cov-fail-under=85`.
- Full gate: see `release-quality-gates.mdc` / `scripts/quality_gates.*`.
